marily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31131429", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045379093", "personaname": "Rubicante", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/madrubicante/", "num_games_owned": 273, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 3813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3477, "last_played": 1549132322, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of rain got me hooked for hours, and I got hooked again when my friends bought it and we played together.\nEven if the game has more than enough qualities to play on your own, I'd say the main point of this game is playing with friends.\nI usually dislike platformers but this one's gameplay, although hard to master, was very rewarding and I wanted to keep trying until I got the hang of it. I should mention that each character has its own distinct gameplay, and that the musics play a great role in the ambience of this game.\nIn a word : not your typical platformer, andvery good game overall.", "timestamp_created": 1492159415, "timestamp_updated": 1492159415, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31128303", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021625231", "personaname": "Furrfire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198021625231/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 2704, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2704, "last_played": 1416267784, "avatar": "e05a67bcafadff858c544c4eae7a9b518202ed75"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's sorta good.\n\nNothing amazing but addictive enough. Once you learn the game well enough it becomes  easy even on hard mode, and especially in coop.\n\nIt's an action game, where you kill baddies to earn money, buy upgrades in level, and sometimes find them too. At the end of each level is a boss summoning item, and then you fight a boss before being able to go to the next level. The longer you take the harder the level becomes, but eventually caps in difficulty- and really doesn't get that hard once you find enough upgrades. There is classes too, that have unique abilities or traits.\n\nThe whole \"random\" part of this isn't terribly random. The levels change in layout a little but the experience is about the same every playthrough. The same strategy wins the game about every time. But that doesn't stop this from being a fun game for a few nights of gameplay.\n\nIt's cheap too! \n\nJust a fun action romp to play with friends. Nothing wrong with that.\n", "timestamp_created": 1492140667, "timestamp_updated": 1492140667, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31117303", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202057328", "personaname": "Valoctris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198202057328/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 777, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 777, "last_played": 1492094896, "avatar": "6e928ef637534b11197b5404fd11d5be3bf27d84"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just know, there is no Risk in buying this game. Thats the truth.", "timestamp_created": 1492093049, "timestamp_updated": 1492093049, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 